+
+``pre_built`` and ``wheel_server_url`` have version-aware variants,
+``is_pre_built(version)`` and ``get_wheel_server_url(version)``.  Values
+under ``variants.<variant>.versions.<version>`` override the variant
+defaults for that version.  The local version segment is ignored for the
+lookup, so ``2.8.0+cpu`` uses the ``2.8.0`` entry.  For ``is_pre_built()``,
+the ``is_pre_built`` override hook runs before the YAML settings when a
+version is given.
+
+The START phase of the bootstrapper calls these methods once the version
+is known.  If the version-specific settings change whether the package is
+pre-built, or change its wheel server, the download URL is resolved again
+for that version.
